# Supabase Edge Functions

## CLI

The `supabase` binary is **not** installed globally in this repo. Always run the CLI via **`npx`** from `packages/supabase`:

```bash
cd packages/supabase
```

Do **not** run bare `supabase …` — it will fail with `command not found`.

## Deploy functions

**All functions** (usual workflow):

```bash
cd packages/supabase && npx supabase functions deploy
```

**Single function**:

```bash
cd packages/supabase && npx supabase functions deploy <function-name>
```

Example:

```bash
cd packages/supabase && npx supabase functions deploy confirm-password-reset
```

Hosted project ref: `canhewvuprjwmpopcloj`  
Dashboard: https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/canhewvuprjwmpopcloj/functions

## First-time / new machine

```bash
cd packages/supabase
npx supabase login
npx supabase link --project-ref canhewvuprjwmpopcloj
```

Then run deploy again.

## Local serve

```bash
cd packages/supabase && npx supabase functions serve
```

## `config.toml` paths

`supabase/config.toml` paths (e.g. email `content_path`) are resolved from **`packages/supabase`**, not from `packages/supabase/supabase/`. Use `./supabase/templates/...` for template files under `supabase/templates/`.

